   ],
   "dialogue": [
    {
     "text": "Ah, awake at last. The Rootwood took you in, little witch, same as it took me. Still got ink in your fingers?",
     "replies": [
      {
       "text": "Where am I?",
       "next": 1
      },
      {
       "text": "What's that glowing stone?",
       "next": 2
      },
      {
       "text": "I'd best be going.",
       "next": -1
      }
     ],
     "teach": "",
     "teachSigil": false
    },
    {
     "text": "Hearth Hollow, at the foot of the Great Root. East, the root climbs up to the treetops. Down the well-stair, the old cellars. Mind the hats.",
     "replies": [
      {
       "text": "How do I climb the Root?",
       "next": 3
      },
      {
       "text": "And the cellars?",
       "next": 5
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you.",
       "next": -1
      }
     ],
     "teach": "",
     "teachSigil": false
    },
    {
     "text": "A shrine. Touch it and a glyph settles in your hand. Then come to the bench here and draw it into a circle. A glyph you never draw is just a scribble.",
     "replies": [
      {
       "text": "And once it's drawn?",
       "next": 4
      },
      {
       "text": "Where am I, again?",
       "next": 1
      }
     ],
     "teach": "",
     "teachSigil": false
    },
    {
     "text": "Walk it. The bark's stepped like a stair, all the way up to the gap in the canopy. Jump at the very top. Flyers nest up there, so go armed.",
     "replies": [
      {
       "text": "And the cellars?",
       "next": 5
      },
      {
       "text": "Farewell.",
       "next": -1
      }
     ],
     "teach": "",
     "teachSigil": false
    },
    {
     "text": "Press B and set it in one of your three slots, then click to cast. A spell needs its breath between casts. Here, a little silver for the road.",
     "replies": [
      {
       "text": "Thank you, Wren.",
       "next": -1
      }
     ],
     "teach": "",
     "teachSigil": false,
     "silver": 15
    },
    {
     "text": "Sister Ilse keeps the cellar lamps. She knows the cold glyphs. Give her my regards. She'll take them better than she takes me.",
     "replies": [
      {
       "text": "I will.",
       "next": -1
      }
     ],
     "teach": "",
     "teachSigil": false
    }
   ]
